<para>&lt; 0x12: 5 V voltage gain trim</para>
<para>&lt; 0x14: NTC offset, 0.1 °C</para>
<para>&lt; 0x16: reserved, 0</para>
<para>&lt; 0x18: write counter (diagnostic)</para>
<para>&lt; 0x1C: CRC-32 over bytes 0x00–0x1B</para>
